{"id":"9ea3fa70993b84c0","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-sequences.md","title":"Sequences","display":"df-sequences — Sequences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sequences","aliases":["58-df-sequences","Sequence","Finite Sequence","Infinite Sequence"],"display":"df-sequences — Sequences","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-natural-number]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sequences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sequences</span><span>Sequence</span><span>Finite Sequence</span><span>Infinite Sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequences — Sequences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0adc4e3c996ff726\" href=\"?note=0adc4e3c996ff726\" title=\"58-df-natural-number\">58-df-natural-number</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}:(\\omega+1)\\times V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}:(\\omega+1)\\times V\\to V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequences\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\mathrm{Seq}(n,X)=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,X)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequences\\text{-}finite} \\vdash \\mathrm{Seq}(n,X)=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(s,n,X)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequences\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\mathrm{Seq}(\\omega,X)=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,X)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequences\\text{-}omega} \\vdash \\mathrm{Seq}(\\omega,X)=\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,X)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有限序列</strong>: 定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n = \\{0,1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(n = \\{0,1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span> 的函数</li>\n<li><strong>无穷序列</strong>: 定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> 的函数</li>\n<li><strong>序列编码</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\">\\(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}\\rangle=\\{\\langle i,x_i\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>序列连接</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s \\^\\ t\" title=\"已兼容原始排版写法\">\\(s \\mathbin{\\text{\\^{}}}\\ t\\)</span> 表示序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 后接序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>对角线论证</strong>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]^{\\mathbb{N}}\">\\([0,1]^{\\mathbb{N}}\\)</span> 不可数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory, Chapter I</li>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 2</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"